---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="CoolPVT — Simulator Fotovoltaic Termic | AlexaVolt" activeNav="home">
  
  <section class="text-center py-12 md:py-16">
    <span class="inline-block bg-orange-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4 tracking-wide">Versiune Web 6.0</span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">
      <span class="text-orange-600">Cool</span><span class="text-slate-900">PVT</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-blue-700 font-medium mb-3">Simulator profesional de dimensionare sisteme fotovoltaice termice</p>
    <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
      Proiectează și dimensionează sisteme fotovoltaice termice (PVT) pentru România. Calcule precise bazate pe date reale de radiație solară, cu analiză economică pe 20 de ani.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-12">
      <a href="/simulator/" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
        Deschide Simulatorul
      </a>
      <a href="/despre/" class="text-blue-700 font-medium hover:underline">
        Află mai multe →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 border-t border-b border-slate-200 py-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">7</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Regiuni România</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">20+</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Panouri PV</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">6</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Metode răcire</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">20 ani</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Analiză economică</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center text-slate-900 mb-4">Fluxul de calcul</h2>
    <p class="text-center text-slate-500 text-sm mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Datele calculate într-un pas sunt preluate automat în pașii următori — nu trebuie să re-introduci nimic manual.</p>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-0">

      <!-- Step 1: Consumatori -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">1</div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center py-1">
            <svg width="20" height="36" viewBox="0 0 20 36" class="text-blue-400"><path d="M10 0 L10 28 M5 23 L10 30 L15 23" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm flex-1 mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xl">🔌</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Calculator Consumatori</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">Bifezi receptoarele electrice din casă. Se calculează consumul lunar total.</p>
          <div class="text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg inline-block font-medium">↓ Trimite: consum lunar [kWh/lună]</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2: Dimensionare -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">2</div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center py-1">
            <svg width="20" height="36" viewBox="0 0 20 36" class="text-orange-400"><path d="M10 0 L10 28 M5 23 L10 30 L15 23" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-orange-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-orange-100 shadow-sm flex-1 mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xl">☀️</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Dimensionare Sistem PV</h3>
            <span class="text-xs bg-orange-200 text-orange-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold ml-auto">Pasul principal</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">Selectezi locație, orientare, unghi, panou. Se calculează nr. panouri, putere instalată și energie produsă/an.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium">↓ nr. panouri</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium">↓ putere [kWp]</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium">↓ energie/an [kWh]</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium">↓ degradare [%/an]</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3: Calcul Electric -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">3</div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center py-1">
            <svg width="20" height="36" viewBox="0 0 20 36" class="text-blue-400"><path d="M10 0 L10 28 M5 23 L10 30 L15 23" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm flex-1 mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xl">⚡</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Calcul Electric</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">Primește automat puterea instalată și nr. panouri. Calculează tensiuni DC, invertor, secțiuni cabluri și protecții.</p>
          <div class="text-xs bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg inline-block font-medium">← Primește: putere, nr. panouri</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4: Racire PV -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">4</div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center py-1">
            <svg width="20" height="36" viewBox="0 0 20 36" class="text-blue-400"><path d="M10 0 L10 28 M5 23 L10 30 L15 23" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm flex-1 mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xl">💨</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Răcire PV</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">Alegi metoda de răcire (disipator, pelicular, PVT). Coeficienții sunt aplicați automat în Dimensionare.</p>
          <div class="text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg inline-block font-medium">↑ Trimite: coeficienți răcire → Dimensionare</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 5: Racire PVT -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">5</div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center py-1">
            <svg width="20" height="36" viewBox="0 0 20 36" class="text-blue-400"><path d="M10 0 L10 28 M5 23 L10 30 L15 23" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm flex-1 mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xl">💧</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Răcire PVT (Termică)</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">Calculează energia termică produsă prin răcire cu apă (țeavă Cu). Primește automat nr. panouri.</p>
          <div class="text-xs bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg inline-block font-medium">← Primește: nr. panouri PVT</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 6: Economic -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">6</div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center py-1">
            <svg width="20" height="36" viewBox="0 0 20 36" class="text-blue-400"><path d="M10 0 L10 28 M5 23 L10 30 L15 23" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm flex-1 mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xl">💰</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Analiză Economică</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">Primește automat nr. panouri, energie/an și degradare. Calculează investiția totală, amortizarea și economiile pe 20 ani.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium">← nr. panouri, energie/an, degradare</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg font-medium">↓ investiție, inflație, preț kWh</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 7: Grafic -->
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">7</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-emerald-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-sm flex-1 mb-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xl">📊</span>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Grafic Amortizare</h3>
            <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold ml-auto">Rezultat final</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">Primește automat toți parametrii economici. Generează graficul sold cumulat pe 20 ani cu punct de amortizare.</p>
          <div class="text-xs bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg inline-block font-medium">← Primește: investiție, energie, preț, inflație, degradare</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
